```jinja
{{ [1,2,3] | zip(['a','b','c','d']) | list }}
# => [[1,"a"],[2,"b"],[3,"c"]]   (stops at the shortest)

{{ [1,2,3] | zip_longest(['a','b','c','d'], fillvalue='X') | list }}
# => [[1,"a"],[2,"b"],[3,"c"],["X","d"]]
```

Build a dict:

```jinja
{{ dict(keys_list | zip(values_list)) }}
```
